    "html": "<div class=\"gc\"><section class=\"ent-hero\"><div class=\"gc-wrap gc-hero-in\"><div><p class=\"gc-eyebrow\">Edilnova</p><h1 class=\"gc-h1\">Building well, <em>one site at a time.</em></h1><p class=\"gc-lead\">Edilnova handles the maintenance, recovery and renovation of buildings: facades, balconies, roofs and interiors. We guide you from the first check to the finished job, with a clear contact at every stage.</p><div class=\"gc-act\"><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-a\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/contact/\">Book a check</a><a class=\"gc-btn gc-btn-o\" href=\"__BASEURL__/en/services/\">Discover our services</a></div></div><div class=\"ent-cycle\"><div><b>First check</b><span>We inspect the building, from above too with a drone</span></div><div><b>Written proposal</b><span>Description of the works and a quote before we start</span></div><div><b>Tidy site</b><span>Trained crews, including for work at height</span></div><div><b>Documented handover</b><span>Photos and a report of what was done</span></div></div></div></section></div>"
